{
  "_comment": [
    "Grok Build discovers this plugin, reports has_hooks=true, and dispatches none",
    "of its hooks. Verified 2026-08-20 in grok's own debug log: the only hook",
    "sources it executed were ~/.grok/hooks/*.json and ~/.claude/settings.json,",
    "while every plugin-bundled hook was discovered and skipped. Registering the",
    "same three events here is what makes a Grok worker record evidence.",
    "",
    "Paths are absolute because CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT is a plugin variable and this is",
    "not a plugin hook. Install with the sed line in the README, which substitutes",
    "__PACKAGE_ROOT__ for the installed plugin root grok plugin details reports.",
    "",
    "The matcher carries both tool names: Grok's shell tool is",
    "run_terminal_command, Claude Code's is Bash, and this file is only read by",
    "Grok but costs nothing by naming both."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"__PACKAGE_ROOT__/hooks/session-start-context.sh\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|run_terminal_command",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"__PACKAGE_ROOT__/hooks/post-tool-journal.sh\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUseFailure": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|run_terminal_command",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash \"__PACKAGE_ROOT__/hooks/post-tool-journal.sh\"",
            "timeout": 15
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
